    "1.16.3-1.0.32": "Remove code that was there for debug - noeppi_noeppi\nA new generic container, a new event and items with inventory - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.33": "Remove the ammo event. See https://github.com/MinecraftForge/MinecraftForge/pull/7715 - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.34": "Some breaking changes to the block and item tag providers. They use the setup layout now like any other libx base provider. This should not be a problem to end users as the classes are only used during datagen. Also some more utility functions for the recipe provider base - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.35": "This will give a duplicate version on curse but I really need to remove the tab characters now. - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.36": "More breaking changes in datagen. This time it's loot tables. As the provider was very limited until now it got a complete overhaul. - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.37": "Rename a method - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.38": "Make it possible to have prefixes in RegisterClass annotations to avoid duplicates and keep field names simple. - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.39": "Change the maven location back - noeppi_noeppi\nAdd a new loot entry type that can select multiple items from its children in one entry. This allows for much more complex loot tables. - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.40": "Add a way to transform the matrixstack for rendering into the world in RenderWorldLastEvent - noeppi_noeppi",
